      "input_intro": {
        "buggy": "Incident: section-level configuration reads no longer honor value conversion.\n\nThe public API returns stored values as text unless a converter is supplied. A missing key returns the supplied default unchanged; its converter must not run. A conversion failure on a present value propagates. A stored empty value remains distinct from a missing key.\n\nWith data `[worker]\\nretries=7`, requesting `config[\"worker\"].get(\"retries\", convert=int)` returns the string `\"7\"`, although an integer is required. The snapshots below are the code under investigation. Repair the cause while preserving the API behavior, rather than special-casing the example.\n",
        "changed-defect": "Incident: section-level configuration reads no longer honor value conversion.\n\nThe public API returns stored values as text unless a converter is supplied. A missing key returns the supplied default unchanged; its converter must not run. A conversion failure on a present value propagates. A stored empty value remains distinct from a missing key.\n\nWith data `[worker]\\nretries=7`, requesting `config[\"worker\"].get(\"retries\", convert=int)` returns the string `\"7\"`, although an integer is required. The snapshots below are the code under investigation. Repair the cause while preserving the API behavior, rather than special-casing the example.\n"
      },
